1
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:56,000
Act natural.

2
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:46,000
Hoppers is a family, comedy, animation film directed by Daniel Chong.

3
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:36,000
Scientists have discovered how to "hop" human consciousness into lifelike robotic
animals, allowing people to communicate with animals as animals.

4
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:26,000
Animal lover Mabel seizes an opportunity to use the technology, uncovering mysteries
within the animal world that are beyond anything she could have imagined.

5
00:29:10,000 --> 00:29:16,000
Mabel Tanaka / Mabel Beaver (voice), played by Piper Curda.

6
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
King George (voice), played by Bobby Moynihan.

7
00:40:50,000 --> 00:40:56,000
Mayor Jerry Generazzo (voice), played by Jon Hamm.

8
00:46:40,000 --> 00:46:46,000
Dr. Sam (voice), played by Kathy Najimy.

9
00:52:30,000 --> 00:52:36,000
Titus (voice), played by Dave Franco.

10
00:58:20,000 --> 00:58:26,000
Loaf (voice), played by Eduardo Franco.

11
01:04:10,000 --> 01:04:16,000
Hoppers is an upcoming American animated science fiction action comedy film
produced by Pixar Animation Studios for Walt Disney Pictures.

12
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
Directed by Daniel Chong from a screenplay by Jesse Andrews, the film
stars the voices of Piper Curda, Bobby Moynihan and Jon Hamm.

13
01:15:50,000 --> 01:15:56,000
It follows an animal lover named Mabel whose mind is transferred into a lifelike robotic beaver
in order to communicate with animals and save their habitat from destruction.

14
01:21:40,000 --> 01:21:46,000
Chong began working on a new original film at Pixar in December 2020.

15
01:27:30,000 --> 01:27:36,000
The film was first officially announced as Hoppers in August 2024, along
with Curda, Moynihan, and Hamm revealed as part of the cast.

16
01:33:20,000 --> 01:33:26,000
Hoppers is scheduled to be released in theaters in
the United States on March 6, 2026.

17
01:39:10,000 --> 01:39:16,000
The tone is lighthearted and thought_provoking.
